  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Matrices : Produit de deux matrices (2×2)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<div style="background: #475569; border-left: 5px solid #334155; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; padding: 10px 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><strong style="font-weight: 800; color: #fff; font-size: .95rem;">Matrices — Produit de matrices</strong> <span style="background: #334155; color: #fff; padding: 2px 9px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: bold;">/ 1 pt</span></div>
<p>Soient les matrices :</p>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 40px; justify-content: center; margin: 15px 0; flex-wrap: wrap;">
<div>\(A = {@A@}\)</div>
<div>\(B = {@B@}\)</div>
</div>
<p><strong>Calculer</strong> le produit \(C = A \times B\).</p>
<p style="font-size: .85rem; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 8px;"><em>Saisir sous la forme : <code style="background: #f1f5f9; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;">matrix([a,b],[c,d])</code></em></p>
<div>\(C = \) [[input:ans_prod]] [[validation:ans_prod]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<div style="margin-top: 20px; padding: 15px; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px;">
<div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">🔑 Correction détaillée</div>
<div style="font-size: .9rem;">
Pour calculer \(C = A \times B\), on effectue le produit ligne par colonne :<br><br>
\[
A \times B = {@A@} \times {@B@} = {@C@}
\]<br>
<strong>Détail des calculs :</strong><br>
• \(c_{11} = ({@a11@})({@b11@}) + ({@a12@})({@b21@}) = {@c11@}\)<br>
• \(c_{12} = ({@a11@})({@b12@}) + ({@a12@})({@b22@}) = {@c12@}\)<br>
• \(c_{21} = ({@a21@})({@b11@}) + ({@a22@})({@b21@}) = {@c21@}\)<br>
• \(c_{22} = ({@a21@})({@b12@}) + ({@a22@})({@b22@}) = {@c22@}\)<br><br>
<em style="color: #64748b;">Rappel : Le produit matriciel n'est <strong>pas commutatif</strong>, en général \(A \times B \neq B \times A\).</em>
</div>
</div>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade>
